{"id":"241e7e90b85de13e","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-split-fhodtt-structure.md","title":"两 sort 演算的严格语境族结构","display":"df-split-fhodtt-structure — 两 sort 演算的严格语境族结构","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"11","label":"16-df-split-fhodtt-structure","aliases":["16-df-split-fhodtt-structure"],"display":"df-split-fhodtt-structure — 两 sort 演算的严格语境族结构","depends_on":["[[16-df-category]]","[[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]]"],"source":"§11.5–§11.6; explicit split algebraic presentation of the supplied two-sort rules","revision_date":"2026-10-19"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"11"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-split-fhodtt-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-split-fhodtt-structure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-split-fhodtt-structure — 两 sort 演算的严格语境族结构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca2d757f82798122\" href=\"?note=ca2d757f82798122\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-syntax\">16-df-fhodtt-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"§11.5–§11.6; explicit split algebraic presentation of the supplied two-sort rules"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定足够大的集合论宇宙。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是候选记录，含小范畴 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span>、对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1\">\\(\\mathbf1\\)</span>、箭头族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"!_\\Gamma\">\\(!_\\Gamma\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a>。sort 集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S=\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal S=\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}\\)</span> 与和消去许可集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathcal A_\\Sigma\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ca2d757f82798122\" href=\"?note=ca2d757f82798122\" title=\"16-df-fhodtt-syntax\">16-df-fhodtt-syntax</a>。</li>\n<li>记录含集合族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ty}_s(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Ty}_s(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathcal S\">\\(s\\in\\mathcal S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_s(\\Gamma)\">\\(A\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_s(\\Gamma)\\)</span>。还含下列型属的候选全函数族：类型与项的重索引、语境扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\triangleright_s A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C\">\\(\\Gamma\\triangleright_s A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p^s_A:\\Gamma\\triangleright_s A\\to\\Gamma\">\\(p^s_A:\\Gamma\\triangleright_s A\\to\\Gamma\\)</span>、泛项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q^s_A\">\\(q^s_A\\)</span>、配对，两个 sort 的单位、四种积/和及其项操作，以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\operatorname{code},\\operatorname{El}\">\\(\\Omega,\\operatorname{code},\\operatorname{El}\\)</span>。本页逐项给出函数的定义域、陪域与要求满足的等式；这些等式才是结构公理，不预先假定任何语法可靠性。</li>\n<li>以下使用有声明域的有限多类元语言。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Theta\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Theta\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\Delta\\to\\Gamma\">\\(\\sigma:\\Delta\\to\\Gamma\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:\\Theta\\to\\Delta\">\\(\\tau:\\Theta\\to\\Delta\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t,u\\in\\mathcal S\">\\(s,t,u\\in\\mathcal S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_s(\\Gamma)\">\\(A\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_s(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_t(\\Gamma\\triangleright_s A)\">\\(B\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_t(\\Gamma\\triangleright_s A)\\)</span>。局部的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma.A,p_A,q_A\">\\(\\Gamma.A,p_A,q_A\\)</span> 分别缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\triangleright_s A,p^s_A,q^s_A\">\\(\\Gamma\\triangleright_s A,p^s_A,q^s_A\\)</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 或别的类型使用相应的 sort。所有操作保留显示的类型参数；无下标的出现按同一式的局部参数展开，重索引项的操作参数也重索引。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf U(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathsf U(\\varphi)\\)</span> 是各个公式各自的普遍闭包：先取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 的自由变量及其声明域递归需要的参数，再按依赖顺序量化。参数表有限且无环；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}_\\varphi\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}_\\varphi\\)</span> 是该表的变量集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_v\">\\(D_v\\)</span> 是变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 的声明域，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}\\)</span> 是元语言自由变量函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 及其记录分量固定，不被此闭包量化。局部额外变量的声明紧随所在公式列出，彼此独立。闭包之前先展开 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,\\delta_{A,B},\\sigma_A^+,\\sigma_{A,B}^{++}\">\\(C,\\delta_{A,B},\\sigma_A^+,\\sigma_{A,B}^{++}\\)</span> 及局部省略下标的定义；关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma\">\\((s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma\\)</span> 在含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的公式中规定其声明域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{u\\in\\mathcal S\\mid(s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma\\}\">\\(\\{u\\in\\mathcal S\\mid(s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma\\}\\)</span>，不限制不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的形成/配对公理。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_A^+,\\bar a,C,\\delta_{A,B},\\sigma_{A,B}^{++}\">\\(\\sigma_A^+,\\bar a,C,\\delta_{A,B},\\sigma_{A,B}^{++}\\)</span> 在下文定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{split}_{A,B,E}^{s,t,u}\">\\(\\operatorname{split}_{A,B,E}^{s,t,u}\\)</span> 是从一个分支项得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma.C\">\\(\\Gamma.C\\)</span> 中项的函数，只有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma\">\\((s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma\\)</span> 时才属于记录。它不赋予受限的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type})\">\\((\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type})\\)</span>-和到 kind 的投影。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nP_\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{P\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_\\varphi\\mid\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq P\\land\n(\\forall v\\in P)\\operatorname{FV}(D_v)\\subseteq P\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf U(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\forall v_1\\in D_{v_1}\\cdots\\forall v_k\\in D_{v_k}\\ \\varphi,\\qquad\nP_\\varphi=\\{v_1,\\ldots,v_k\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(D_{v_i})\\subseteq\\{v_j\\mid j&lt;i\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{SplitFHo}(S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal C)\\land\n\\bigwedge_{i=1}^{6}\\mathsf F_i(S).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nP_\\varphi&amp;\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{P\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_\\varphi\\mid\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq P\\land\n(\\forall v\\in P)\\operatorname{FV}(D_v)\\subseteq P\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf U(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\forall v_1\\in D_{v_1}\\cdots\\forall v_k\\in D_{v_k}\\ \\varphi,\\qquad\nP_\\varphi=\\{v_1,\\ldots,v_k\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(D_{v_i})\\subseteq\\{v_j\\mid j&lt;i\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{SplitFHo}(S)&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal C)\\land\n\\bigwedge_{i=1}^{6}\\mathsf F_i(S).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf F_1(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf U\\bigl(\\mathcal C(\\Gamma,\\mathbf1)=\\{!_\\Gamma\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(A[\\sigma]\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_s(\\Delta)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(a[\\sigma]\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Delta,A[\\sigma])\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(A[1_\\Gamma]=A)\n\\land\\mathsf U(A[\\sigma\\tau]=A[\\sigma][\\tau])\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(a[1_\\Gamma]=a)\n\\land\\mathsf U(a[\\sigma\\tau]=a[\\sigma][\\tau]),\n\\qquad a\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf F_1(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf U\\bigl(\\mathcal C(\\Gamma,\\mathbf1)=\\{!_\\Gamma\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(A[\\sigma]\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_s(\\Delta)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(a[\\sigma]\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Delta,A[\\sigma])\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(A[1_\\Gamma]=A)\n\\land\\mathsf U(A[\\sigma\\tau]=A[\\sigma][\\tau])\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(a[1_\\Gamma]=a)\n\\land\\mathsf U(a[\\sigma\\tau]=a[\\sigma][\\tau]),\n\\qquad a\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf F_2(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf U(p_A\\in\\mathcal C(\\Gamma.A,\\Gamma))\n\\land\\mathsf U(q_A\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma.A,A[p_A]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\langle\\sigma,a&#39;\\rangle_A\\in\\mathcal C(\\Delta,\\Gamma.A))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(p_A\\langle\\sigma,a&#39;\\rangle_A=\\sigma)\n\\land\\mathsf U(q_A[\\langle\\sigma,a&#39;\\rangle_A]=a&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\langle p_Ah,q_A[h]\\rangle_A=h),\\\\\n&amp;a&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Delta,A[\\sigma]),\\qquad h\\in\\mathcal C(\\Delta,\\Gamma.A),\\\\\n\\sigma_A^+&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\sigma p_{A[\\sigma]},q_{A[\\sigma]}\\rangle_A:\n\\Delta.A[\\sigma]\\to\\Gamma.A,\\\\\n\\bar a&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle1_\\Gamma,a\\rangle_A:\\Gamma\\to\\Gamma.A,\\qquad\na\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A),\\\\\n\\sigma_{A,B}^{++}&amp;\\coloneqq(\\sigma_A^+)_B^+:\n\\Delta.A[\\sigma].B[\\sigma_A^+]\\to\\Gamma.A.B.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf F_2(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf U(p_A\\in\\mathcal C(\\Gamma.A,\\Gamma))\n\\land\\mathsf U(q_A\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma.A,A[p_A]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\langle\\sigma,a&#39;\\rangle_A\\in\\mathcal C(\\Delta,\\Gamma.A))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(p_A\\langle\\sigma,a&#39;\\rangle_A=\\sigma)\n\\land\\mathsf U(q_A[\\langle\\sigma,a&#39;\\rangle_A]=a&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\langle p_Ah,q_A[h]\\rangle_A=h),\\\\\n&amp;a&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Delta,A[\\sigma]),\\qquad h\\in\\mathcal C(\\Delta,\\Gamma.A),\\\\\n\\sigma_A^+&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\sigma p_{A[\\sigma]},q_{A[\\sigma]}\\rangle_A:\n\\Delta.A[\\sigma]\\to\\Gamma.A,\\\\\n\\bar a&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle1_\\Gamma,a\\rangle_A:\\Gamma\\to\\Gamma.A,\\qquad\na\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A),\\\\\n\\sigma_{A,B}^{++}&amp;\\coloneqq(\\sigma_A^+)_B^+:\n\\Delta.A[\\sigma].B[\\sigma_A^+]\\to\\Gamma.A.B.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf F_3(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf U(1^s_\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_s(\\Gamma))\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,1^s_\\Gamma)=\\{*^s_\\Gamma\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(1^s_\\Gamma[\\sigma]=1^s_\\Delta)\n\\land\\mathsf U(*^s_\\Gamma[\\sigma]=*^s_\\Delta).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf F_3(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf U(1^s_\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_s(\\Gamma))\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,1^s_\\Gamma)=\\{*^s_\\Gamma\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(1^s_\\Gamma[\\sigma]=1^s_\\Delta)\n\\land\\mathsf U(*^s_\\Gamma[\\sigma]=*^s_\\Delta).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf F_4(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf U(\\Omega_\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_{\\mathsf{Kind}}(\\Gamma))\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\Omega_\\Gamma[\\sigma]=\\Omega_\\Delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(\\operatorname{code}_\\Gamma:\n\\operatorname{Ty}_{\\mathsf{Type}}(\\Gamma)\\to\n\\operatorname{Tm}_{\\mathsf{Kind}}(\\Gamma,\\Omega_\\Gamma)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(\\operatorname{El}_\\Gamma:\n\\operatorname{Tm}_{\\mathsf{Kind}}(\\Gamma,\\Omega_\\Gamma)\\to\n\\operatorname{Ty}_{\\mathsf{Type}}(\\Gamma)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{El}_\\Gamma(\\operatorname{code}_\\Gamma(D))=D)\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{code}_\\Gamma(\\operatorname{El}_\\Gamma(c))=c)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{code}_\\Gamma(D)[\\sigma]=\n\\operatorname{code}_\\Delta(D[\\sigma]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{El}_\\Gamma(c)[\\sigma]=\n\\operatorname{El}_\\Delta(c[\\sigma])),\\\\\n&amp;D\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_{\\mathsf{Type}}(\\Gamma),\\qquad\nc\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_{\\mathsf{Kind}}(\\Gamma,\\Omega_\\Gamma).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf F_4(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf U(\\Omega_\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_{\\mathsf{Kind}}(\\Gamma))\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\Omega_\\Gamma[\\sigma]=\\Omega_\\Delta)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(\\operatorname{code}_\\Gamma:\n\\operatorname{Ty}_{\\mathsf{Type}}(\\Gamma)\\to\n\\operatorname{Tm}_{\\mathsf{Kind}}(\\Gamma,\\Omega_\\Gamma)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(\\operatorname{El}_\\Gamma:\n\\operatorname{Tm}_{\\mathsf{Kind}}(\\Gamma,\\Omega_\\Gamma)\\to\n\\operatorname{Ty}_{\\mathsf{Type}}(\\Gamma)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{El}_\\Gamma(\\operatorname{code}_\\Gamma(D))=D)\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{code}_\\Gamma(\\operatorname{El}_\\Gamma(c))=c)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{code}_\\Gamma(D)[\\sigma]=\n\\operatorname{code}_\\Delta(D[\\sigma]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{El}_\\Gamma(c)[\\sigma]=\n\\operatorname{El}_\\Delta(c[\\sigma])),\\\\\n&amp;D\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_{\\mathsf{Type}}(\\Gamma),\\qquad\nc\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_{\\mathsf{Kind}}(\\Gamma,\\Omega_\\Gamma).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf F_5(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf U(\\Pi^{s,t}(A,B)\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_t(\\Gamma))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(\\lambda^{s,t}_{A,B}:\n\\operatorname{Tm}_t(\\Gamma.A,B)\\to\n\\operatorname{Tm}_t(\\Gamma,\\Pi^{s,t}(A,B))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(\\operatorname{app}^{s,t}_{A,B}(f,a)\n\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_t(\\Gamma,B[\\bar a])\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{app}_{A,B}^{s,t}(\\lambda_{A,B}^{s,t}(b),a)=b[\\bar a])\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(\n\\lambda_{A,B}^{s,t}(\n\\operatorname{app}_{A[p_A],B[(p_A)_A^+]}^{s,t}(f[p_A],q_A))=f\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\Pi^{s,t}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\n\\Pi^{s,t}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma_A^+]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\lambda_{A,B}^{s,t}(b)[\\sigma]=\n\\lambda_{A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma_A^+]}^{s,t}(b[\\sigma_A^+]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{app}_{A,B}^{s,t}(f,a)[\\sigma]=\n\\operatorname{app}_{A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma_A^+]}^{s,t}(f[\\sigma],a[\\sigma])),\\\\\n&amp;f\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_t(\\Gamma,\\Pi^{s,t}(A,B)),\\quad\na\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A),\\quad b\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_t(\\Gamma.A,B).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf F_5(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf U(\\Pi^{s,t}(A,B)\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_t(\\Gamma))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(\\lambda^{s,t}_{A,B}:\n\\operatorname{Tm}_t(\\Gamma.A,B)\\to\n\\operatorname{Tm}_t(\\Gamma,\\Pi^{s,t}(A,B))\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(\\operatorname{app}^{s,t}_{A,B}(f,a)\n\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_t(\\Gamma,B[\\bar a])\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{app}_{A,B}^{s,t}(\\lambda_{A,B}^{s,t}(b),a)=b[\\bar a])\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(\n\\lambda_{A,B}^{s,t}(\n\\operatorname{app}_{A[p_A],B[(p_A)_A^+]}^{s,t}(f[p_A],q_A))=f\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\Pi^{s,t}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\n\\Pi^{s,t}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma_A^+]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\lambda_{A,B}^{s,t}(b)[\\sigma]=\n\\lambda_{A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma_A^+]}^{s,t}(b[\\sigma_A^+]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{app}_{A,B}^{s,t}(f,a)[\\sigma]=\n\\operatorname{app}_{A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma_A^+]}^{s,t}(f[\\sigma],a[\\sigma])),\\\\\n&amp;f\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_t(\\Gamma,\\Pi^{s,t}(A,B)),\\quad\na\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A),\\quad b\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_t(\\Gamma.A,B).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nC&amp;\\coloneqq\\Sigma^{s,t}(A,B),\\\\\n\\delta_{A,B}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle p_Ap_B,\\\n\\operatorname{pair}_{A[p_Ap_B],B[(p_Ap_B)_A^+]}^{s,t}\n(q_A[p_B],q_B)\\right\\rangle_C:\\Gamma.A.B\\to\\Gamma.C,\\\\\n\\mathsf F_6(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf U(\\Sigma^{s,t}(A,B)\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_t(\\Gamma))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{pair}_{A,B}^{s,t}(a,b&#39;)\n\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_t(\\Gamma,C))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\Sigma^{s,t}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\n\\Sigma^{s,t}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma_A^+]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{pair}_{A,B}^{s,t}(a,b&#39;)[\\sigma]=\n\\operatorname{pair}_{A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma_A^+]}^{s,t}(a[\\sigma],b&#39;[\\sigma]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U\\left(\n\\operatorname{split}_{A,B,E}^{s,t,u}:\n\\operatorname{Tm}_u(\\Gamma.A.B,E[\\delta_{A,B}])\\to\n\\operatorname{Tm}_u(\\Gamma.C,E)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U\\left(\n\\operatorname{split}_{A,B,E}^{s,t,u}(d)\n[\\overline{\\operatorname{pair}_{A,B}^{s,t}(a,b&#39;)}]\n=d[\\langle\\bar a,b&#39;\\rangle_B]\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{split}_{A,B,E}^{s,t,u}(e[\\delta_{A,B}])=e)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U\\left(\n\\operatorname{split}_{A,B,E}^{s,t,u}(d)[\\sigma_C^+]\n=\\operatorname{split}_{A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma_A^+],E[\\sigma_C^+]}^{s,t,u}\n(d[\\sigma_{A,B}^{++}])\\right),\\\\\n&amp;a\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A),\\quad\nb&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_t(\\Gamma,B[\\bar a]),\\\\\n&amp;(s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma,\\quad\nE\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_u(\\Gamma.C),\\\\\n&amp;d\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_u(\\Gamma.A.B,E[\\delta_{A,B}]),\\qquad\ne\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_u(\\Gamma.C,E).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nC&amp;\\coloneqq\\Sigma^{s,t}(A,B),\\\\\n\\delta_{A,B}&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle p_Ap_B,\\\n\\operatorname{pair}_{A[p_Ap_B],B[(p_Ap_B)_A^+]}^{s,t}\n(q_A[p_B],q_B)\\right\\rangle_C:\\Gamma.A.B\\to\\Gamma.C,\\\\\n\\mathsf F_6(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathsf U(\\Sigma^{s,t}(A,B)\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_t(\\Gamma))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{pair}_{A,B}^{s,t}(a,b&#39;)\n\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_t(\\Gamma,C))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\Sigma^{s,t}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\n\\Sigma^{s,t}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma_A^+]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{pair}_{A,B}^{s,t}(a,b&#39;)[\\sigma]=\n\\operatorname{pair}_{A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma_A^+]}^{s,t}(a[\\sigma],b&#39;[\\sigma]))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U\\left(\n\\operatorname{split}_{A,B,E}^{s,t,u}:\n\\operatorname{Tm}_u(\\Gamma.A.B,E[\\delta_{A,B}])\\to\n\\operatorname{Tm}_u(\\Gamma.C,E)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U\\left(\n\\operatorname{split}_{A,B,E}^{s,t,u}(d)\n[\\overline{\\operatorname{pair}_{A,B}^{s,t}(a,b&#39;)}]\n=d[\\langle\\bar a,b&#39;\\rangle_B]\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{split}_{A,B,E}^{s,t,u}(e[\\delta_{A,B}])=e)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathsf U\\left(\n\\operatorname{split}_{A,B,E}^{s,t,u}(d)[\\sigma_C^+]\n=\\operatorname{split}_{A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma_A^+],E[\\sigma_C^+]}^{s,t,u}\n(d[\\sigma_{A,B}^{++}])\\right),\\\\\n&amp;a\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A),\\quad\nb&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_t(\\Gamma,B[\\bar a]),\\\\\n&amp;(s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma,\\quad\nE\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_u(\\Gamma.C),\\\\\n&amp;d\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_u(\\Gamma.A.B,E[\\delta_{A,B}]),\\qquad\ne\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_u(\\Gamma.C,E).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是所给两 sort 演算的严格代数呈现。普通范畴模型中的重索引通常只满足相干同构；本结构明确选择满足严格等式的语境族和构造操作，因而可直接解释语法的判断相等。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{code}/\\operatorname{El}\">\\(\\operatorname{code}/\\operatorname{El}\\)</span> 是按类型对象严格分类的双射；它不要求垂直同构的两个类型有同一个分类码。</p>\n<p>六组公理分别规定语境和代入、理解、单位、Type 分类、四种依赖积、四种依赖和及其许可消去。每条公理独立普遍闭包，故项集合为空时不会使无关的形成或语境公理真空成立。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_{A,B}\">\\(\\delta_{A,B}\\)</span> 是把两个末尾变量配成和类型项的语境箭头；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\">\\(\\beta\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span> 精确说沿该箭头替换在许可的目标 sort 上与 split 互逆。</p>\n<p>本页不以“保存所有规则”定义模型，也不预设可导判断有效。递归解释和规则归纳由后续文件给出；只有本页所列代数等式用于该归纳。它是为原悬空的 FHoDTT 解释及完备性补入的内部结构，未加入独立 Prop、相等反射、归纳类型或累积宇宙。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"ca2d757f82798122","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定足够大的集合论宇宙。$S$ 是候选记录，含小范畴 $\\mathcal C$、对象 $\\mathbf1$、箭头族 $!_\\Gamma$；$\\mathrm{Cat}$ 采用 [[16-df-category]]。sort 集 $\\mathcal S=\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}$ 与和消去许可集 $\\mathcal A_\\Sigma$ 采用 [[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fhodtt-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"ca2d757f82798122","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定足够大的集合论宇宙。$S$ 是候选记录，含小范畴 $\\mathcal C$、对象 $\\mathbf1$、箭头族 $!_\\Gamma$；$\\mathrm{Cat}$ 采用 [[16-df-category]]。sort 集 $\\mathcal S=\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}$ 与和消去许可集 $\\mathcal A_\\Sigma$ 采用 [[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1","display":false},{"tex":"!_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S=\\{\\mathsf{Type},\\mathsf{Kind}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ty}_s(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A)","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_s(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\triangleright_s A\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"p^s_A:\\Gamma\\triangleright_s A\\to\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"q^s_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega,\\operatorname{code},\\operatorname{El}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\Delta,\\Theta\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma:\\Delta\\to\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau:\\Theta\\to\\Delta","display":false},{"tex":"s,t,u\\in\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_s(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"B\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_t(\\Gamma\\triangleright_s A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma.A,p_A,q_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\triangleright_s A,p^s_A,q^s_A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf U(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}_\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"D_v","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"C,\\delta_{A,B},\\sigma_A^+,\\sigma_{A,B}^{++}","display":false},{"tex":"(s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"\\{u\\in\\mathcal S\\mid(s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma\\}","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_A^+,\\bar a,C,\\delta_{A,B},\\sigma_{A,B}^{++}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{split}_{A,B,E}^{s,t,u}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma.C","display":false},{"tex":"(s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"(\\mathsf{Kind},\\mathsf{Type})","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nP_\\varphi&\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\{P\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_\\varphi\\mid\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)\\subseteq P\\land\n(\\forall v\\in P)\\operatorname{FV}(D_v)\\subseteq P\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf U(\\varphi)&\\coloneqq\n\\forall v_1\\in D_{v_1}\\cdots\\forall v_k\\in D_{v_k}\\ \\varphi,\\qquad\nP_\\varphi=\\{v_1,\\ldots,v_k\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(D_{v_i})\\subseteq\\{v_j\\mid j<i\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{SplitFHo}(S)&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Cat}(\\mathcal C)\\land\n\\bigwedge_{i=1}^{6}\\mathsf F_i(S).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf F_1(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathsf U\\bigl(\\mathcal C(\\Gamma,\\mathbf1)=\\{!_\\Gamma\\}\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(A[\\sigma]\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_s(\\Delta)\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(a[\\sigma]\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Delta,A[\\sigma])\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(A[1_\\Gamma]=A)\n\\land\\mathsf U(A[\\sigma\\tau]=A[\\sigma][\\tau])\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(a[1_\\Gamma]=a)\n\\land\\mathsf U(a[\\sigma\\tau]=a[\\sigma][\\tau]),\n\\qquad a\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf F_2(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathsf U(p_A\\in\\mathcal C(\\Gamma.A,\\Gamma))\n\\land\\mathsf U(q_A\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma.A,A[p_A]))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\langle\\sigma,a'\\rangle_A\\in\\mathcal C(\\Delta,\\Gamma.A))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(p_A\\langle\\sigma,a'\\rangle_A=\\sigma)\n\\land\\mathsf U(q_A[\\langle\\sigma,a'\\rangle_A]=a')\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\langle p_Ah,q_A[h]\\rangle_A=h),\\\\\n&a'\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Delta,A[\\sigma]),\\qquad h\\in\\mathcal C(\\Delta,\\Gamma.A),\\\\\n\\sigma_A^+&\\coloneqq\\langle\\sigma p_{A[\\sigma]},q_{A[\\sigma]}\\rangle_A:\n\\Delta.A[\\sigma]\\to\\Gamma.A,\\\\\n\\bar a&\\coloneqq\\langle1_\\Gamma,a\\rangle_A:\\Gamma\\to\\Gamma.A,\\qquad\na\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A),\\\\\n\\sigma_{A,B}^{++}&\\coloneqq(\\sigma_A^+)_B^+:\n\\Delta.A[\\sigma].B[\\sigma_A^+]\\to\\Gamma.A.B.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf F_3(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathsf U(1^s_\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_s(\\Gamma))\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,1^s_\\Gamma)=\\{*^s_\\Gamma\\})\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(1^s_\\Gamma[\\sigma]=1^s_\\Delta)\n\\land\\mathsf U(*^s_\\Gamma[\\sigma]=*^s_\\Delta).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf F_4(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathsf U(\\Omega_\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_{\\mathsf{Kind}}(\\Gamma))\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\Omega_\\Gamma[\\sigma]=\\Omega_\\Delta)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(\\operatorname{code}_\\Gamma:\n\\operatorname{Ty}_{\\mathsf{Type}}(\\Gamma)\\to\n\\operatorname{Tm}_{\\mathsf{Kind}}(\\Gamma,\\Omega_\\Gamma)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(\\operatorname{El}_\\Gamma:\n\\operatorname{Tm}_{\\mathsf{Kind}}(\\Gamma,\\Omega_\\Gamma)\\to\n\\operatorname{Ty}_{\\mathsf{Type}}(\\Gamma)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{El}_\\Gamma(\\operatorname{code}_\\Gamma(D))=D)\n\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{code}_\\Gamma(\\operatorname{El}_\\Gamma(c))=c)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{code}_\\Gamma(D)[\\sigma]=\n\\operatorname{code}_\\Delta(D[\\sigma]))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{El}_\\Gamma(c)[\\sigma]=\n\\operatorname{El}_\\Delta(c[\\sigma])),\\\\\n&D\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_{\\mathsf{Type}}(\\Gamma),\\qquad\nc\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_{\\mathsf{Kind}}(\\Gamma,\\Omega_\\Gamma).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf F_5(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathsf U(\\Pi^{s,t}(A,B)\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_t(\\Gamma))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(\\lambda^{s,t}_{A,B}:\n\\operatorname{Tm}_t(\\Gamma.A,B)\\to\n\\operatorname{Tm}_t(\\Gamma,\\Pi^{s,t}(A,B))\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(\\operatorname{app}^{s,t}_{A,B}(f,a)\n\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_t(\\Gamma,B[\\bar a])\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{app}_{A,B}^{s,t}(\\lambda_{A,B}^{s,t}(b),a)=b[\\bar a])\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U\\bigl(\n\\lambda_{A,B}^{s,t}(\n\\operatorname{app}_{A[p_A],B[(p_A)_A^+]}^{s,t}(f[p_A],q_A))=f\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\Pi^{s,t}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\n\\Pi^{s,t}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma_A^+]))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\lambda_{A,B}^{s,t}(b)[\\sigma]=\n\\lambda_{A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma_A^+]}^{s,t}(b[\\sigma_A^+]))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{app}_{A,B}^{s,t}(f,a)[\\sigma]=\n\\operatorname{app}_{A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma_A^+]}^{s,t}(f[\\sigma],a[\\sigma])),\\\\\n&f\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_t(\\Gamma,\\Pi^{s,t}(A,B)),\\quad\na\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A),\\quad b\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_t(\\Gamma.A,B).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nC&\\coloneqq\\Sigma^{s,t}(A,B),\\\\\n\\delta_{A,B}&\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle p_Ap_B,\\\n\\operatorname{pair}_{A[p_Ap_B],B[(p_Ap_B)_A^+]}^{s,t}\n(q_A[p_B],q_B)\\right\\rangle_C:\\Gamma.A.B\\to\\Gamma.C,\\\\\n\\mathsf F_6(S)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathsf U(\\Sigma^{s,t}(A,B)\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_t(\\Gamma))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{pair}_{A,B}^{s,t}(a,b')\n\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_t(\\Gamma,C))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\Sigma^{s,t}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\n\\Sigma^{s,t}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma_A^+]))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{pair}_{A,B}^{s,t}(a,b')[\\sigma]=\n\\operatorname{pair}_{A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma_A^+]}^{s,t}(a[\\sigma],b'[\\sigma]))\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U\\left(\n\\operatorname{split}_{A,B,E}^{s,t,u}:\n\\operatorname{Tm}_u(\\Gamma.A.B,E[\\delta_{A,B}])\\to\n\\operatorname{Tm}_u(\\Gamma.C,E)\\right)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U\\left(\n\\operatorname{split}_{A,B,E}^{s,t,u}(d)\n[\\overline{\\operatorname{pair}_{A,B}^{s,t}(a,b')}]\n=d[\\langle\\bar a,b'\\rangle_B]\\right)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U(\\operatorname{split}_{A,B,E}^{s,t,u}(e[\\delta_{A,B}])=e)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathsf U\\left(\n\\operatorname{split}_{A,B,E}^{s,t,u}(d)[\\sigma_C^+]\n=\\operatorname{split}_{A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma_A^+],E[\\sigma_C^+]}^{s,t,u}\n(d[\\sigma_{A,B}^{++}])\\right),\\\\\n&a\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_s(\\Gamma,A),\\quad\nb'\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_t(\\Gamma,B[\\bar a]),\\\\\n&(s,t,u)\\in\\mathcal A_\\Sigma,\\quad\nE\\in\\operatorname{Ty}_u(\\Gamma.C),\\\\\n&d\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_u(\\Gamma.A.B,E[\\delta_{A,B}]),\\qquad\ne\\in\\operatorname{Tm}_u(\\Gamma.C,E).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{code}/\\operatorname{El}","display":false},{"tex":"\\delta_{A,B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta","display":false}],"bytes":9681,"backlinks":[{"id":"f94e7143755d4851","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"以下 $S$ 另外表示 [[16-df-split-fhodtt-structure]] 的候选严格记录，使用该页各个带型属操作；$\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}$ 在下节定义，不与普通记录 $M$ 混用。"},{"id":"ca2d757f82798122","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"本原子给出形成接口；与项、结构和转换规则合起来的有限推导演算在 [[16-df-fhodtt-terms]] 定义。可选的多型相等扩展应明确选择 [[16-df-identity-type]] 的规则包，不能以 $r$ 引入冒充 equality reflection。与本页规则匹配的严格结构及其可靠性、完备性采用 [[16-df-split-fhodtt-structure]] 和 [[16-df-fhodtt-term-model]]；普通非分裂模型的相干选择不在该严格版本定理的量词中。"},{"id":"0fc14f4a062b4abf","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"范畴、集合族、重索引和各项操作的目标格式采用 [[16-df-split-fhodtt-structure]]；$\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}$ 和递归解释采用 [[16-df-fhodtt-cat-model]]。下式不是把句法模型性放进前提，而是先给全部分量再断言它满足结构公理。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-dtt-signature]]、[[16-df-split-dtt-structure]]、[[16-df-dtt-model]]、[[16-df-dtt-model-morphism]]、[[16-df-term-model]]、[[16-thm-term-model-initial]]、[[16-df-dtt-internal-language]]、[[16-thm-internal-language]]、[[16-thm-dtt-completeness]]、[[16-df-identity-type]]、[[16-df-identity-relative-equality]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-syntax]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-terms]]、[[16-df-split-fhodtt-structure]]、[[16-df-fhodtt-term-model]]、[[16-thm-fhodtt-soundness]]、[[16-thm-fhodtt-completeness]]、[[16-prop-fhodtt-kind-reflection]]。DTT 结果使用明确的强片段与严格态射；FHoDTT 的可靠性和完备性使用匹配其语法的两 sort 严格模型。内部语言评价是否覆盖整个模型，由语境生成条件判定。"}],"outgoing":["25a281534aa42440","ca2d757f82798122"]}